      "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#dimension_46e3d566",
      "@type": "OverallIntent",
      "instance_name": "overallintent_instance",
      "label": "the overallintent",
      "description": "meme-id: meme_image; hasOverallIntent: Hateful; overall-intent-description: The image depicts a pig in a cage with overlaid text that reads, 'you know why muslims hates pigs? because they fuck donkeys!'. This meme uses a false and derogatory stereotype to mock Muslims by falsely attributing a baseless biological claim (pigs mating with donkeys) to them. This is a clear example of Islamophobia, as it relies on a harmful and inaccurate trope to demean a religious group. The intent is to provoke offense and ridicule by exploiting a sensitive religious taboo (the prohibition of pork in Islam) and distorting it with an absurd and offensive biological claim, thereby reinforcing prejudice and hostility toward Muslims. The juxtaposition of the innocent-looking pig with the vulgar, false claim serves to amplify the hateful message.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
        "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#analysis_b9f1f569"
      },
      "extractionMethod": "llm_extraction_huggingface"
