      "description": "The meme is designed to target and provoke members of the general public who may hold or be susceptible to Islamophobic views, by leveraging a false and offensive stereotype about Muslims and pigs. The content is crafted to reinforce prejudice against Muslims by mocking their religious practices (pork prohibition) with a baseless and vulgar biological claim (pigs mating with donkeys), making it particularly aimed at audiences who either already harbor Islamophobic sentiments or are susceptible to such harmful tropes.",
